+      "fsm": "crabcraft.controller.toml",
+      "_why": "A bundle of its own rather than six modes added to `jumper`, which is laid out as the robot's operator guide, Control-agent 3.1, and has no skills in it. The modes copied from `jumper` carry its fields without its comments; the `jumper` bundle in deploy/manifests.json is where each one is explained.",
+      "_reached_by": "The skills sit on Menu chords because every pad button alone is taken in locomotion (A the jump, LB and RB the claws, B the release, R3 the posture's shift) and the d-pad is the gestures'. While Menu is held the button answers only the chord. X and Y carry the dictionary's `unresolved` note: which physical button each is has not been pressed to settle. The keyboard's 5 6 7 8 9 0 sit next to the gestures' 1 2 3 4.",
